Electric vehicle recharging infrastructure systems shall comply with minimum requirements concerning:
(a) energy efficiency;
(b) operational availability and reliability;
(c) durability and serviceability after sales capability; and
(d) interoperability with applicable European standards.
In view of the connected and critical nature of electric vehicle recharging infrastructure, the systems referred to in paragraph 1 shall also comply with requirements concerning:
(a) cybersecurity;
(b) the protection of personal and non-personal data; and
(c) system integrity, security and control.
The Commission shall ensure that the requirements referred to in the previous paragraph are consistent with applicable Union law on cybersecurity, data protection and the resilience and protection of critical infrastructure.

amendments.ins_ko:
전기 자동차 충전 인프라 시스템은 다음과 관련된 최소 요구 사항을 준수해야 합니다.
